---
import Figure from "../Figure.astro";
---
<Figure width="wide">
  <div class="multi" id="multi"></div>
  <div class="legend"><span><i class="ln" style="background:var(--fig-ink)"></i>best so far</span><span><i style="background:#0A84FF"></i>diff</span><span><i style="background:#E8A33D"></i>rewrite</span><span><i style="background:#3DAE7C"></i>cross</span><span><i style="background:#A66BE0"></i>idea</span><span>each dot is one attempt</span></div>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    <b>Six first-generation runs from scratch.</b> Each panel is one run: best score so far against attempts, with
    every attempt as a dot coloured by the kind of edit.
  </Fragment>
</Figure>
